[0.0-3.5] caller: Good morning, this is Medicare calling about your new card.
[4.1-6.9] elder: I didn't know I needed a new one.
[7.5-13.1] caller: Everyone has to switch this week or lose coverage. I just need to verify your number.
[13.7-16.1] elder: Can't I do this at the office?
[16.7-19.8] caller: There's no time for that, the deadline is today.
[20.4-21.9] elder: Well, I'm not sure.
[22.5-26.3] caller: If you don't do it now, your benefits will be frozen.
